# board_live_1147.env -- PURPOSE: a recorded facts sample for the tests (test_jetson_facts.py): the owner's Jetson as
# the read-only live probe of 2026-10-31 11:47 saw it (D:\suas_scratch\coord\jetson_probe.md "LIVE PROBE"), written in
# the KEY=VALUE shape lib/remote_facts.sh prints. The team's flight stack was running then, so this board is BUSY.
